@startuml
title Payment Settlement

|Payer client|
start
:Enter recipient, amount, and date;
:Submit payment;

|Service|
:Authorize group membership;
:Derive current outstanding obligation;
if (Positive amount, correct currency,
 and within outstanding amount?) then (yes)
  |PostgreSQL|
  :Persist payment as PENDING;
  |Service|
  :Return pending payment;
  note right
    Pending payments do not
    affect balances.
  end note
else (no)
  :Return validation error;
  stop
endif

|Recipient client|
:Review pending payment;
:Confirm receipt;

|Service|
:Verify caller is recipient;
:Recheck outstanding amount;
|PostgreSQL|
if (Still valid and payment is PENDING?) then (yes)
  :Atomically transition to CONFIRMED;
  :Commit once;
  |Service|
  :Return confirmed payment;
  note right
    Derived balance decreases
    by the confirmed amount.
  end note
else (no)
  :Keep payment pending;
  |Service|
  :Return conflict/validation message;
endif
stop
@enduml
